{"seq":16,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-06-phl-tickets/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T02:26:12.013Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"6610b09f80dc4cd59b35b4e9f67d0e75668662e2e70048cd9b951a41791074e2","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Bettina, here's what I found for Kwame's review. Nothing about either account in #coastal-team or #coastal-random, so it all comes from Moss's Coastal digests, plus one of your own public notes.\n\n*Pellucid Harbor Logistics (Gulf Coast)*\n• Ticket #4419: `Yard_Dwell_Summary` report times out when filtered by container length. Open. (Coastal cheat sheet)\n• Ticket #PD-8841: chassis pool holds on double-booked gates, Gate 4B. (your 2025-12-08 Pellucid cutover recap, not a Moss note)\n• No ticket number: chassis pool validation at Gate 4 during shift change, listed as the main friction point. (Coastal cheat sheet)\n• No feature requests found.\n\n*Driftmoor Marine Freight (Puget Sound)*\n• Feature request #882: warehouse managers asked for a bulk-clear button for departed barges. (Coastal cheat sheet)\n• Ticket #4419: barge slip 7 schedule sync. DMF also asked for a patched manifest CSV before the 06:00 shift. (Moss digest, 2025-11-02)\n• No ticket number: tide-table import macro failed on Terminal B. Engineering gave the night dispatcher a manual CSV patch. (Coastal cheat sheet)\n\n*Two things to check*\n• #4419 appears under both accounts with different subjects: the Yard_Dwell report for PHL in the cheat sheet, and the slip 7 sync for DMF in the 11/2 digest. One of them is probably a typo, so check the ticket system before the review.\n• The Moss notes don't say whether any of these are still open, except #4419 on the PHL side. The 11/2 digest is almost a year old.\n\nI left out Pellow Home Living (PD-4821 and #8812) and Saltmarsh. Both have tickets that share the PHL shorthand or the same folders.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":17,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-06-phl-tickets/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T02:26:17.876Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"38b5cd7bcfae59b74e8bc6496a5905e248db2b600fae1f0761bbc1b3b72c8ed8","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"I posted the list as a reply to Bettina's message in #coastal-team. Neither #coastal-team nor #coastal-random mentions either account, so everything comes from Moss's Coastal digests plus one public note of Bettina's.\n\n**Pellucid Harbor Logistics**\n- **Ticket #4419:** the `Yard_Dwell_Summary` report times out when filtered by container length. It's marked open in Moss's Coastal cheat sheet.\n- **Ticket #PD-8841:** chassis pool holds on double-booked gates at Gate 4B. This comes from Bettina's own 2025-12-08 cutover recap, not a Moss note.\n- **No ticket number:** chassis pool validation at Gate 4 during shift change, which the cheat sheet lists as the main friction point.\n- **Feature requests:** none found.\n\n**Driftmoor Marine Freight**\n- **Feature request #882:** warehouse managers want a bulk-clear button for departed barges (cheat sheet).\n- **Ticket #4419:** barge slip 7 schedule sync, with a request for a patched manifest CSV before the 06:00 shift (Moss digest, 2025-11-02).\n- **No ticket number:** the tide-table import macro failed on Terminal B, and engineering gave the night dispatcher a manual CSV patch (cheat sheet).\n\nI flagged two things for Bettina to check before the review:\n- **#4419 appears under both accounts** with different subjects, so one of the two is probably a typo.\n- **Open or closed:** the notes only mark #4419 on the PHL side as open. The DMF items come from a digest almost a year old.\n\nI left out Pellow Home Living (PD-4821 and #8812) and Saltmarsh (PD-4824, PD-4827)."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
